"\n"
"Osobola okugikyusa mu ngalo wano ng’oyingiza koodi y’ekitundu ya ISO ey’ennukuta 2 (e.g. US, FI, DE) oba koodi eyita (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:332
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system tone."
msgstr ""
"Tone y’okukuba eddoboozi lye ddoboozi erikubiddwa (toot-toot-toot) nga olindirira essimu efuluma okuddibwamu. Abamu ku ba carriers tebagikola kale tulina option okugikola mu ngalo wano. \n"
"\n"
"Osobola okulonda fayiro yo ey’omuziki, oba okugirongoosa okukozesa eddoboozi ly’enkola erya bulijjo."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:352
